      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 23, \"total_count\": 23, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers cannot attach their own photos\", \"actual\": \"The Photos control is a button labelled \\\"Add Photo\\\" / \\\"Click to add sample images (up to 4)\\\" that inserts a canned stock image; the page contains no input[type=file] (document.querySelectorAll('input[type=file]').length === 0), so a seller cannot upload their own product photo. All other submitted data was retained: new listing \\\"Upcycled Crate Side Table\\\" displays Upcycled badge, Furniture, Good, $60, Brooklyn NY, Listed 2026-08-27, description and seller Emma Green.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No edit capability for existing listings\", \"actual\": \"/my-listings offers only View, Mark Sold and Delete per listing (buttons on page: New Listing, View, Mark Sold, Delete); the owner's product-detail page shows only a \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" link. There is no way to edit title, description, photos, price, category, condition, location or upcycled status of an existing listing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /my-listings: \\\"Mark Sold\\\" flipped status observable to \\\"Sold\\\" and button to \\\"Mark Available\\\" instantly; \\\"Mark Available\\\" restored \\\"Active\\\"; Delete opened confirmation dialog \\\"Delete listing?\\\" (Cancel/Delete) and confirming removed the row immediately with toast \\\"Listing deleted\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"While marked Sold, the listing was absent from browse (count back to \\\"10 items available\\\") and its detail page replaced buyer actions with \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" (product.unavailable) — no Add to Cart / Message Seller rendered. After deletion it is likewise absent from browse results.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered \\\"Quinn Tester\\\" / quinn.tester@example.com / \\\"secret123\\\" (9 chars) / Denver, CO → toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\", redirected to /, header shows signed-in state with avatar alt \\\"Quinn Tester\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No maximum-price filter control\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Price Range\\\" filter renders a single slider thumb (aria-label \\\"Minimum\\\", range 0-500). Only the minimum price can be changed ($0-$500 → $100-$500); there is no control to lower the maximum price, so a buyer cannot combine a max-price criterion. Category, condition, distance, upcycled filters and newest/price/distance sorts each worked (e.g. Furniture+New+Upcycled → 2 matching items; price-low sort ordered $35→$320).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"portland\\\"→3 results all Portland, OR; \\\"HEADPHONES\\\"→1 (title match); \\\"LEVI\\\"→1 (prod-2, word only in description \\\"Classic 90s Levi's...\\\"); clearing query restored 10 items available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Signed in as Emma Green; added prod-2 ($65, Marcus's) twice → cart count stayed 1; added prod-9 ($35) → cart shows 2 items, each line with photo, title, location (San Francisco, CA / Austin, TX) and price; Total $100.00 = 65+35.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Emma on prod-6 (Marcus's, available): Message Seller dialog \\\"Send a message to Marcus Chen\\\"; Send disabled while empty; after typing a message and sending, toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" appeared and dialog closed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selection does not filter browse results\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Home Decor\\\" (labelled \\\"2 items\\\") on /categories navigated to /?category=home-decor, but browse showed all 10 listings and the count read \\\"10 items available\\\"; the Home Decor filter toggle remained false (semantic_observe value=false).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers have no way to view purchase requests / buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"As buyer Quinn Tester I sent a direct request on prod-2 (\\\"QA-REQUEST-777...\\\", toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\") and a cart request for prod-2+prod-9 (toast \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\"). Signing in as the seller marcus@example.com, /my-listings shows only the listings with View/Mark Sold/Delete and no requests/messages section; prod-2's detail page as owner contains no request or buyer message (body text does not contain \\\"QA-REQUEST-777\\\"); the only other account page, /profile, renders the 404 \\\"Return to Home\\\" page. The cart flow reports requests as sent with no recorded, viewable request for any cart item.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with notregistered@example.com stayed on /login; header still shows Log in/Sign up, no session created (no error text shown, but attempt rejected).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering \\\"Fake Emma\\\" with EMMA@Example.com (case variation of existing emma@example.com) was rejected with \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\"; stayed on /register, no session created, existing Emma Green account untouched.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password is not verified during authentication\", \"actual\": \"Signing in as emma@example.com with the arbitrary password \\\"definitely-wrong-password-xyz\\\" succeeded: redirected to / and header changed to signed-in state (Sell menu). Login page even states \\\"any password works\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Emma: her own listing detail (prod-1787855913447) shows \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" and no buyer actions; /my-listings lists only her 3 listings with View/Mark Sold/Delete. Other sellers' listings (prod-2 Marcus, prod-6 Marcus, prod-9 Sofia) expose only Add to Cart and Message Seller — no seller-management controls.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by required fields (validationMessage \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\" on title/description/price); with text filled but no category/condition → toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\"; with those set but no photo → toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\". No listing created in any case (stayed on /create-listing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price is input[type=number][min=0][step=0.01][required]: entering -25 blocked submit with \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\"; non-numeric text cannot be entered at all (Playwright: \\\"Cannot type text into input[type=number]\\\"). No listing created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Gated areas blocked without any sign-in prompt or redirect; message dialog silently non-functional\", \"actual\": \"Signed out: /create-listing and /cart render a completely blank page (document.body.innerText === \\\"\\\", no header, no prompt, no redirect). On a product page the \\\"Message Seller\\\" dialog still opens for an anonymous visitor and clicking Send does nothing at all — dialog stays open, no confirmation, no error, no redirect to login. Only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" behaved correctly by redirecting to /login.\", \"ev